ure Functions with .NET in Visual Studio | Azure Friday","url":"https://channel9.msdn.com/Shows/Azure-Friday/Deploy-OpenAPI-enabled-Azure-Functions-with-NET-in-Visual-Studio","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/deploy-openapi-enabled-azure-functions-with-net-in-visual-studio-azure-friday-tqgmhagwe","summary":"Justin Yoo demonstrates an extension he developed for adding OpenAPI capabilities to Azure Functions apps. See how easy it is to get HTTP-triggered .NET functions with OpenAPI support and deploy an Azure Functions app with Azure API Management from Visual Studio. Submit your answers to our five-question quiz about the info Scott and Justin covered. Eligible participants who answer all five questions correctly will be entered into a Sweepstakes with a chance to win a box of Microsoft swag.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/830d9722dadd21343d54e66150092c30","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-11-12T20:10:00.853Z"},{"id":"o8LFxaJRy","title":"Looking at Azure yesterday, today, and tomorrow with Jason Zander | Azure Friday","url":"https://channel9.msdn.com/Shows/Azure-Friday/Looking-at-Azure-yesterday-today-and-tomorrow-with-Jason-Zander","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/looking-at-azure-yesterday-today-and-tomorrow-with-jason-zander-azure-friday-o8lfxajry","summary":"Jason Zander, executive vice president of the Azure Team, joins Scott Hanselman to celebrate the 8th anniversary of Azure Friday. In this special crossover episode with Hanselminutes, they reflect on Azure's history and Jason's career at Microsoft during that timeframe.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/41a8e23f8e5c37b0b92a1a99f9ed868c","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2021-11-12T01:12:09.260Z"},{"id":"8qpcUxRV5","title":"Data Loading Best Practices on Azure SQL Database","url":"https://channel9.msdn.com/Shows/Data-Exposed/Data-Loading-Best-Practices-on-Azure-SQL-Database